# The mirror (an extension): New Group > Mirror with an edge selected
# says what to select; with a face of the extrusion of path_extrude
# selected, the extrusion is reflected in it and joined to it. Its
# screen names the plane and keeps the original or not.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
click-entity 80030004
answer ok
menu Features|Mirror
key esc
click-face top face of g003-extrude
menu Features|Mirror
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 276 145
twdown L 276 145
twup L 276 145
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
